---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title='planet34.org'>
	<main
		class='flex flex-col gap-y-3 text-xl font-body ml-2 md:ml-24 p-4 max-w-3xl rounded-md'
	>
		<h1 class='font-header text-8xl'>Hi</h1>

		<p>
			I'm Andrei,a Frontend developer and systems nerd. I work with web
			technologies to make interactive experiences for people.
		</p>

		<p>
			You can find me on
			<a
				href='https://github.com/treipatru'
				target='__blank'
				>github</a
			>
			and
			<a
				href='https://fosstodon.org/@treipatru'
				target='__blank'
				>mastodon</a
			>.
		</p>

		<p>
			Sometimes I post photos on
			<a
				href='https://revelator.planet34.org'
				target='__blank'
				>revelator</a
			>, a photo blog I've been maintaining on and off over the years.
		</p>

		<p>
			If you are interested in working together or just want to say hi, send me
			an <a href='mailto:andrei@planet34.org'>e-mail</a>.
		</p>
	</main>
</Layout>
